I use this in combination with homebridge and homebridge-script2 plugin. 
https://github.com/pponce/homebridge-script2
homebridge-script2 is a plugin that allow you to execute scripts to turn on/off and check state of different devices via homekit/siri
Here is a sample homebridge-script2 configuration:
